# Contact form endpoint.
#
# The site is statically exported, so there is no server route to post to.
# Set this to any service that accepts a JSON POST — Formspree, Web3Forms,
# Basin, a Cloudflare Worker, etc.
#
# If it is left unset, the contact form falls back to composing a pre-filled
# email in the visitor's mail client, so enquiries are never lost silently.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
